'''Riceball Cat''' (ネコにぎり Nekonigiri, Onigiri Cat) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Riceball Cat
|image = E 138.png
|first appearance = [[Oh Yokozuna! (Expert)]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 20|Infernal Tower - Floor 20]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
Unlike its [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Cat Unit counterpart]] (high health), this enemy has lower health than most of the Awakened enemies, but he moves much faster, has double the attack range, attacks non-stop, and deals increased damage.

